SPOILER ALERT: This post contains spoilers for The Gilded Age Season 4's fourth episode .

George Russell&#x2019;s gunshot wound is coming back to haunt him in a way as Season 4 of The Gilded Age reaches its midpoint.

As has been building since last season when George survived an assassination attempt in his home, a troubling laudanum addiction has come to light for the railroad tycoon, whose behavior early on in the season has grown more and more unpredictable.

&#x201C;I think it is fairly easy, when you have a long-term injury, and you do have lingering pain, to fall into opiate addiction. I think that is a real thing, but I also think George is someone with a really indomitable will. And I think for someone like him, in our story, to slip into the situation, I think there's something else going on in his life,&#x201D; Spector told Deadline. &#x201C;I think that something else is the destabilization of his relationship with Bertha. I don't think that's entirely it. I think, after the shooting last season, he's really having a gigantic midlife crisis. He's built this enormous empire, and he&#x2019;s suddenly realized he doesn't really know who he is anymore, what his values are, and if and if he wants to keep living his life the way he has been, so I think the laudanum comes along at just exactly the wrong time for him.&#x201D; blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dsk-tab-mid-article1-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid","mid-articleX","mid-article","300x251"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[2,2],[300,250],[620,350],[300,251],[501,282],[3,3],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366]]) .exemptFromSleep() .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

George is under extra pressure this season with President Grover Cleveland (Jim Gaffigan) in town and working on antitrust legislature, which would threaten the railroad monopoly he has worked so hard to construct and protect. Add J.D. Rockefeller (Neal Huff) into the equation wanting to cut back prices he pays Russell Industries to transport his oil, and George feels very cornered in business. Spector had hinted that his character was already having a "crisis of conflict" in Season 3. Watch on Deadline if ( !window.pmc.harmony?.isEventAdScheduledTime() ) { pmcCnx.cmd.push(function() { pmcCnx({ settings: { plugins: { pmcAtlasMG: { iabPlcmt: 2, } } }, playerId: '32fe25c4-79aa-406a-af44-69b41e969e71', playlistId: '0199e506-e642-7728-8264-463efe71337b', }).render("connatix_contextual_player_div"); }); } else { // This should only be get called when page cache is not cleared and it's event time. window.pmc.harmony?.switchToHarmonyPlayer(); }

&#x201C;Rockefeller was this really interesting character, and so we learned more about him from the research. I'm from Cleveland, and he's originally from Cleveland. And he basically bankrupted Toledo or some city. He ripped them off, but he was also really pious, and he did do the price fixing,&#x201D; co-showrunner Sonja Warfield told Deadline. &#x201C;That's something he did do. He was ruthless in business, but in church all the time. I love to put characters under pressure. I think it's where the magic happens, and George and the laudanum &#x2014;Doctor [Erica] Dunbar had actually suggested that last season.&#x201D; blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dl-mid-article-inject2-uid1' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article2","mid-articleX","mid-article","mid","300x251"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article2") .addSize([[300,250],[300,251],[620,350],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366]]) .exemptFromSleep() .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

The tincture of opium was prescribed by the white doctor who attended to George&#x2019;s gunshot wound after Dr. William Kirkland (Jordan Donica) saved Mr. Russell&#x2019;s life in Season 3.

&#x201C;She did say, &#x2018;You know that you can get addicted to it,&#x2019; and so we planted that last season, and what I love is that, Morgan plays it just so deftly and just beautifully &#x2014; this vulnerable side of George. And in the first season we see George, there&#x2019;s a character who gets down on his knees and begs him, &#x2018;Spare us,&#x2019; and now George is is really at his knees [on this],&#x201D; Warfield said.

Will Morris (Will Pullen) turned out to be the man responsible for the attempt on George's life, and there is history between the two, because Will is the son of Patrick Morris, the business partner of George's who took his own life in Season 1 after a deal he made with railroad magnate went bad.

A meeting with Daniel Manning, Secretary of the Treasury during the first two years of Grover Cleveland's presidency is one of the last instinces of Season 4 in which George exhibits normal behavior despite his substance abuse. It's explicitly established during that chat that President Cleveland thinks "monopolies threaten our way of government." George wants to meet with the president, and also Rockefeller, to convince the United States leader that he could gain him political backing in New York for re-election, which George things is iffy for Cleveland. Vieweres can't help but notice similarities with the merger taking place between Paramount and Warner Bros.

&#x201C;About the merger thing, Julian and Sonia have a really fantastic record of being a little clairvoyant in terms of the things that they choose to take on in these seasons, and I think partly that's because there are just so many structural parallels between the era at the end of the 19th century and the era we're living in now in terms of wealth inequality and concentration of monopoly power,&#x201D; Spector said. &#x201C;And what's fascinating is that those structural similarities create really similar consequences, and that's because of the way capitalism works. These are systemic dynamics, and they play out in similar ways, no matter what time you're living in. So yeah, I think either Julian is Nostradamus or maybe there are some structural issues with our political economic system.&#x201D;

George also confronts Rockefeller at the gentleman's club they both frequent for business and social life, displaying increasingly erratic behavior and raised voice, as he communicates to the oil baron his plan to get President Cleveland on their side.

Missoni pillows, a dark chocolate square and a pour of Blanton&#x2019;s single-barrel bourbon isn&#x2019;t just reserved for hotel turn-down service anymore &#x2014; it&#x2019;s also the new standard for Delta travelers flying in the airline&#x2019;s Delta One cabin.

The U.S. airline unveiled its so-called &#x201C;next era&#x201D; of Delta One last month, with food and hospitality offerings that aim to position Delta as the &#x201C;industry&#x2019;s most premium end-to-end travel experience,&#x201D; according to a release.

The new offerings include a reimagined Delta One menu, with a wagyu brioche burger among the highlights, along with a Hong Kong-style sea bass, Japanese grilled salmon and a &#x201C;seasonally rotating&#x201D; risotto dish, all served on new Delta-branded tableware. The airline is also touting its &#x201C;fresh cracked pepper service,&#x201D; with flight attendants coming by with a pepper grinder similar to top restaurants and steakhouses. blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-article-mid-article-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid-articleX","mid","mid-article"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[300,250],[2,2],[300,251],[620,350],[2,4],[4,2],[320,480],[620,366],[300,450],[4,4],[300,251]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; }); Related Stories Lifestyle The Hotel Bel-Air's Menu Returns to Tradition Lifestyle After 114 Years, the Beverly Hills Hotel Gets a (Night)life

Dessert now includes the passenger-favorite ice cream cart, with the added option of a fruit sorbet paired with a splash of Taittinger Champagne. And the wines and spirits list has been fully updated with sommelier-approved bottles, including a Silver Oak Cabernet Sauvignon from Napa, which often retails for upwards of $200 in stores .

Travelers can now also request Blanton&#x2019;s Single Barrel Bourbon on board, with the beloved Kentucky straight bourbon whiskey served in mini versions of its iconic decanter-style glass bottles with horse and jockey stopper. New Delta One flights to and from Tokyo-Haneda airport, meantime, will have a sake program designed by renowned sake brewer Dassai 45 from Japan&#x2019;s Yamaguchi Prefecture. The menu on the U.S. to Japan flights will also feature regional cuisine designed in collaboration with Michelin-starred chef, Norio Ueno. blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dsk-tab-mid-article2-uid1' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid","mid-article2","mid-articleX"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article2") .addSize([[300,250],[300,251],[620,350],[2,4],[4,2],[320,480],[620,366],[300,450],[4,4]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

The most visible upgrades begin as Delta One customers arrive to their seats. While Delta&#x2019;s next-generation Delta One suites will start rolling out next year, with longer lie-flat seats, larger TV screens and even a glasses hook, the current suites feature new amenity kits from Missoni along with a mini Missoni pillow and compression socks from Bombas. That&#x2019;s in addition to the existing Missoni bedding and an over-the-seat mattress pad which adds about a quarter-inch of extra cushioning.

The amenity kits have already drawn comparisons to KLM&#x2019;s keepsake Delft Blue ceramic houses as &#x201C;in the know&#x201D; collectibles for frequent fliers. Delta says it&#x2019;s working with Missoni to release different prints each season, following the vein of the Italian fashion house&#x2019;s runway collections each year (the Missoni-print pillow is not a take-home accessory unfortunately).

Delta says the new enhancements were &#x201C;informed by two decades of customer insights&#x201D; and part of the airline&#x2019;s larger $1 billion investment into upgrading its fleet.

Stephanie Laster, Delta&#x2019;s Managing Director of Onboard Experience, likens it to a &#x201C;hotel and restaurant [experience] in the sky,&#x201D; noting that a number of hours were spent perfecting even the tiniest details, like &#x201C;getting the hot towel right with the temperature and moisture and consistency,&#x201D; to selecting the &#x201C;right whipped cream at altitude for our ice cream sundaes.&#x201D;

The Delta One Wagyu burger, meantime, came from the success of the Delta One Burger in Delta One Lounges across the U.S., and from customers craving some &#x201C;comfort food&#x201D; in the air. And the Champagne Sorbet offers a lighter, dairy-free addition to the dessert cart. As for the Blanton&#x2019;s offering: a Delta rep says whiskey is Delta&#x2019;s top-consumed spirit category, and after doing customer research on various brands, Blanton&#x2019;s was rated &#x201C;most-premium&#x201D; of all the bourbons surveyed. blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-thr-article-mid-articleX-uid2' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["btf","mid-articleX","mid"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-articleX") .addSize([[300,250],[300,251],[620,350],[320,480],[620,366],[300,450],[4,4]]) .setLazyLoadMultiplier(2) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

Laster says non-drinkers will also have increased options, including new mocktail creations. And with flyers valuing flexibility more and more, Delta has rolled out a &#x201C;Lighter Later&#x201D; option, with the ability to pre-select meals that fit your diet (I.e. gluten-free dishes or protein-added salads) and even skip a full breakfast in favor of a to-go coffee and croissant, just before landing (all the better to get some extra shut eye).

The new overhaul has launched on transoceanic Delta One routes departing from Los Angeles International Airport, and will expand across the full global network in 2027. As for what passengers in premium economy and economy can expect? Laster says the goal is to provide a &#x201C;premium for all&#x201D; experience when flying Delta, with the airline hoping to eventually unveil upgrades to the rear cabins as well.

&#x201C;Luxury is about having the experience designed around you &#x2014; today&#x2019;s premium traveler values choice as much as quality,&#x201D; says Kristen Manion Taylor, SVP &#x2013; Brand Experience, in a release. &#x201C;These enhancements offer greater flexibility, ensuring every Delta One customer can enjoy the journey in the way that suits them best.&#x201D;

Don Toliver &#x2019;s concert at Co-op Live in Manchester, England ended in an evacuation as tear gas was released in the crowd on Sunday.

&#x201C;It is understood that a substance believed to be tear gas was let off in the crowd towards the end of a concert," wrote the Greater Manchester Police in a statement. According to police, the evacuation was a precaution, and no &#x201C;serious injuries&#x201D; were reported. Related Stories ‘The Remarried Empress’ Becomes Most-Viewed Local Original Premiere Ever on Disney+ and Hulu Rich Eisen's 'Beautiful Day': Landing All Four Members of U2 as Guests

The statement concluded: &#x201C;Please stay away from the arena whilst emergency services help those that have been at the concert safely make their way to their transport home. A major incident has been declared to ensure emergency services and partner agencies can work together quickly and effectively to coordinate a safe response.&#x201D; blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-variety-article-mid-article-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid-articleX","mid","mid-article"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[300,250],[2,2],[300,251],[2,4],[4,2],[320,480],[620,366],[300,450]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

A rep for the force said further updates would be available in the coming hours. Reps for Toliver did not immediately respond to Variety&#x2019;s request for comment.

In a video shared to X , an official at the concert announced that the show would be finished for the evening &#x201C;due to unforeseen circumstances.&#x201D;

&#x201C;In your own time, please make your way to the nearest exit," he said. "If you require medical assistance, please speak to a member of staff or visit the level zero concourse.&#x201D;

On Tuesday, days before the concert, Toliver announced &#x201C;Nitrous,&#x201D; his sixth album, would be released Dec. 4. The day prior, Toliver received five nominations for the 2027 Grammy Awards, including best new artist, best rap album, best rap performance, best rap song and best melodic rap performance.

